BT 1 0 0 1 0 48 Tm 14.5 TL /F1 10 Tf 0 .007843 .133333 rg (This project designs a simple alert circuit: when the push button is pressed, a 5 V supply drives an ) Tj /F2 10 Tf (active) Tj T* (buzzer) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( and, in parallel, a ) Tj /F2 10 Tf (red LED with a current-limiting resistor) Tj /F1 10 Tf (, so the user gets both an audible and) Tj T* (a visual indication. The design was taken through the full KiCad flow: schematic, footprint assignment,) Tj T* (PCB placement and routing, 2D/3D inspection, BOM and Gerber output.) Tj T* ET
Q
