BT 1 0 0 1 0 48 Tm /F1 10 Tf 14.5 TL (The 5 V input from connector J2 \(through the source V1\) reaches the push switch SW1. While SW1 is) Tj T* (pressed, current flows into two parallel branches: \(a\) buzzer BZ1 directly, and \(b\) resistor R1 in series with) Tj T* (LED D1. Both return to GNDPWR. A PWR_FLAG is placed on the ground net so the Electrical Rules) Tj T* (Check recognises it as a powered net.) Tj T* ET
